            <fr:title text="Displayed Category of IsoFibers">Displayed Category of IsoFibers</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Given a functor <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F : \mathcal {C} \to  \mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex>, we can define a
<fr:link href="/sss-00EB/" title="Displayed Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EB/" display-uri="sss-00EB" type="local">displayed category</fr:link> of fibers along <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F]]></fr:tex> up to isomorphism using the
<fr:link href="/sss-0069/" title="Reindexing of a Displayed Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-0069/" display-uri="sss-0069" type="local">reindexing construction</fr:link> on
<fr:link href="/sss-0067/" title="Displayed Category of Isomorphisms" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-0067/" display-uri="sss-0067" type="local">the displayed category of isomorphisms</fr:link>. </html:p>
            <html:p>First we can reindex the category of isomorphisms to get
<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {reindex}_{\mathsf {Id} \times  F}{\mathopen {}\left (\mathsf {Iso_{D}}\right )\mathclose {}}]]></fr:tex>, a displayed category over
<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {D} \times  \mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex>. Then using the observation that
<fr:link href="/sss-006C/" title="Products of Categories as Total Categories" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-006C/" display-uri="sss-006C" type="local">product categories arise as total categories</fr:link>, we can
invoke the <fr:link href="/sss-006B/" title="Displayed Total Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-006B/" display-uri="sss-006B" type="local">displayed total category construction</fr:link> to
repackage the data of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {reindex}_{\mathsf {Id} \times  F}{\mathopen {}\left (\mathsf {Iso_{D}}\right )\mathclose {}}]]></fr:tex> as a
category displayed over <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex>, which we call <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {IsoFiber_{F}}]]></fr:tex>.
</html:p>
